#. module: nme_reporting
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_nme_reporting
msgid ""
"=============================\n"
"Nusantara ERP - Reporting\n"
"=============================\n"
"\n"
"Dashboard and analysis reports of Nusantara Mini ERP.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Features\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* **Dashboard** (OWL client action), the landing page of the Nusantara ERP\n"
"  app: sales of the month, orders to deliver, receivables, overdue invoices,\n"
"  payables, products below minimum, purchases to approve, and a chart of\n"
"  the sales of the last six months. Each card opens the matching records.\n"
"  Figures are computed in one call with the rights of the user: cards about\n"
"  documents the user cannot read are not shown.\n"
"* **Sales analysis** (SQL view) per order line with the margin of the\n"
"  delivered goods: revenue of the delivered quantity minus the value of the\n"
"  delivery moves at average cost, customer returns included.\n"
"* **Purchase analysis** with the average net unit price per vendor/product.\n"
"* **Stock by warehouse**: quantity per internal location from the stock\n"
"  ledger, valued at the average cost of the location's company.\n"
"* **Export to Excel** (xlsxwriter) of the stock, receivable/payable aging\n"
"  and sales by product, and a **PDF aging report** by partner and bucket\n"
"  (custom ``report.*`` model).\n"
"\n"
"Technical notes\n"
"===============\n"
"\n"
"* The dashboard is an OWL 3 component (``proxy`` state, ``useChart`` hook\n"
"  with the Chart.js bundle of the web client) with a Hoot unit test in\n"
"  ``static/tests``, run by the web test suite when Chrome is available.\n"
"* SQL views declare ``_depends`` so that pending ORM writes are flushed\n"
"  before they are read.\n"
"\n"
"Security\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"Each report follows the groups of its source documents: sales users see the\n"
"analysis of their own orders, purchase users the purchase analysis,\n"
"inventory users the stock report; all of them are filtered by company.\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Author\n"
"------\n"
"\n"
"* M. Fadli Kurniawan\n"
"\n"
"License\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"LGPL-3\n"
msgstr ""
"=============================\n"
"Nusantara ERP - Laporan\n"
"=============================\n"
"\n"
"Dasbor dan laporan analisis untuk Nusantara Mini ERP.\n"
"\n"
"**Daftar isi**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Fitur\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"* **Dasbor** (client action OWL), halaman utama aplikasi Nusantara ERP:\n"
"  penjualan bulan ini, pesanan belum dikirim, piutang, faktur lewat jatuh\n"
"  tempo, hutang, produk di bawah stok minimum, pembelian menunggu\n"
"  persetujuan, serta grafik penjualan enam bulan terakhir. Setiap kartu\n"
"  membuka data yang sesuai. Angka dihitung dalam satu panggilan sesuai hak\n"
"  akses pengguna: kartu untuk dokumen yang tidak dapat dibaca pengguna\n"
"  tidak ditampilkan.\n"
"* **Analisis Penjualan** (view SQL) per baris pesanan dengan margin barang\n"
"  terkirim: pendapatan dari jumlah yang dikirim dikurangi nilai pergerakan\n"
"  pengiriman berdasarkan biaya rata-rata, termasuk retur pelanggan.\n"
"* **Analisis Pembelian** dengan harga satuan bersih rata-rata per\n"
"  pemasok/produk.\n"
"* **Stok per Gudang**: jumlah per lokasi internal dari buku besar stok,\n"
"  dinilai dengan biaya rata-rata perusahaan pemilik lokasi.\n"
"* **Ekspor ke Excel** (xlsxwriter) untuk stok, umur piutang/hutang dan\n"
"  penjualan per produk, serta **laporan umur piutang/hutang dalam PDF** per\n"
"  mitra dan rentang umur (model ``report.*`` kustom).\n"
"\n"
"Catatan teknis\n"
"==============\n"
"\n"
"* Dasbor merupakan komponen OWL 3 (state ``proxy``, hook ``useChart``\n"
"  dengan bundle Chart.js dari web client) dengan unit test Hoot di\n"
"  ``static/tests``, yang dijalankan oleh rangkaian pengujian web jika\n"
"  Chrome tersedia.\n"
"* View SQL mendeklarasikan ``_depends`` agar penulisan ORM yang tertunda\n"
"  disimpan (flush) terlebih dahulu sebelum view dibaca.\n"
"\n"
"Keamanan\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"Setiap laporan mengikuti grup dari dokumen sumbernya: pengguna penjualan\n"
"melihat analisis pesanan mereka sendiri, pengguna pembelian melihat analisis\n"
"pembelian, pengguna inventaris melihat laporan stok; semuanya difilter\n"
"berdasarkan perusahaan.\n"
"\n"
"Kredit\n"
"======\n"
"\n"
"Penulis\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"* M. Fadli Kurniawan\n"
"\n"
"Lisensi\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"LGPL-3\n"

